, "id": "9", "resolution": "640x640"}, {"url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/657888248_1628863715026418_6742579196793301608_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzg2NzU0Mjg4MDgzOTgzMTAxMTE3OTU3MDE0MzkyMTA1NjY2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=9X9aIdM_saUQ7kNvwHGCzUe&_nc_oc=Adr1e8UYD56Oi2Qegf8OdQJTjf7no3mK5Of0SJ7QvR8hjEpWiaMrnBk3QedDuxmYXV8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=SK9W7srrEXOSdfl0NixCDg&_nc_ss=7ba8c&oh=00_AQP7JOtpNEv5R-8qqoI0r_REhtXW1T5dr77XDRmB3pOC6w&oe=6ACD99AE", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "javierpoup", "author_id": "37769266427", "id": "17989259696865320", "text": "Maestro", "timestamp": 1790716066, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ismaelibaculima", "author_id": "303477815", "id": "18115895267072335", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1790479687, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "beamindset8", "author_id": "72127508274", "id": "18031487687675610", "text": "Todos en algún momento hemos creído que Dios no nos escucha pero desconocemos el camino para que eso suceda❤️", "timestamp": 1790459311, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "minguaba", "author_id": "4853638840", "id": "17961640457991103", "text": "✍️🙏", "timestamp": 1790051903, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "fernandobalarezolazaro", "author_id": "37899673170", "id": "17920173075224936", "text": "Gracias papá Dios", "timestamp": 1789497265, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "monakaryna", "author_id": "1105278390", "id": "18101974012992548", "text": "Yo fui salvada sanada y se cayó el velo de mis ojos 🙌con este versículo donde tenía que avanzar también \nCon temor desconocimiento y temblando 🙌avance \nY luego vi el milagro en mi vida", "timestamp": 1789407656, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tonymurillo1328", "author_id": "8083706787", "id": "17881880157512503", "text": "Usted señor tiene que ser mi maestro", "timestamp": 1789240251, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "circadyan_", "author_id": "61962961543", "id": "18153969010517553", "text": "AMEN❤️👏", "timestamp": 1789057495, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tonhy_lip", "author_id": "70487785942", "id": "18410367319087294", "text": "😢😢😢👏👏👏", "timestamp": 1788904826, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "cami.murielvs", "author_id": "280032356", "id": "17986573338101851", "text": "Dios mío es tan cierto 🙌", "timestamp": 1788839448, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "disc_dios_dinero_", "author_id": "37889566448", "id": "17867259444648883", "text": "Uno avanza dios hace su parte 🙏🏻", "timestamp": 1788468786, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "valentinoaf1", "author_id": "55245506420", "id": "17917733316442536", "text": "Wooooow! Esto es poderoso! 😍👏🔥", "timestamp": 1788113328, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "hectorvicezar", "author_id": "60850775978", "id": "17980750416082070", "text": "Amén 🙌🏻 🙏🏻", "timestamp": 1788038799, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chrisgguwg", "author_id": "49525613710", "id": "18148087756537032", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1787269332, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ismael_gc_isc", "author_id": "188511894", "id": "18613469641023801", "text": "La historia de Moises toda fuera de contexto, manipulada para que su mensaje motivacional se acomode. Dios si le dice, \"porque clamas a mi?\" Perooooo no es cierto que el mar se abrio porque el pueblo avanzó. Sino porque Dios le dijo a Moises que alzara la vara que le dio y dividiera el mar. Y asi hizo Moises.", "timestamp": 1786723178, "like_count": 3}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWsRcJODI3j/?stkn=MWFzMXU0NTZ5cXpjZg==", "webpage_url_basename": "DWsRcJODI3j", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/657888248_1628863715026418_6742579196793301608_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzg2NzU0Mjg4MDgzOTgzMTAxMTE3OTU3MDE0MzkyMTA